ong>Liquidation delivers tightly balanced battles where every unit and ability serves a clear, intentional role.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game encourages thoughtful army composition and mid\u2011sized forces, striking a sweet spot between micro\u2011level control and macro\u2011level strategy. This creates a battlefield where smart tactical choices, clever positioning, and well-timed abilities can swing the tide and secure decisive advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Commanders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/extras/5ea52f19bd1accb513aa1631e04a6ac3.poster.avif?t=1776167905\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/extras/5ea52f19bd1accb513aa1631e04a6ac3.webm?t=1776167905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/extras/5ea52f19bd1accb513aa1631e04a6ac3.mp4?t=1776167905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liquidation\u2019s story is driven by powerful commanders who serve as the narrative centerpieces.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commanders level up and unlock new abilities as the campaign progresses. Commanders are not meant to overshadow the armies they lead. Even the strongest commander cannot stand alone. Every strength comes with a weakness. This creates a world where heroes matter, but armies remain essential.</p>","developers":["Divio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/header.jpg?t=1776167905","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92023 Divio s.r.o. All righ