.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776167905","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/9e36d9d754b83cbba3a845c4e83d19ca7689ace4/ss_9e36d9d754b83cbba3a845c4e83d19ca7689ace4.600x338.jpg?t=1776167905"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/f20aee598cf31823dc33590950365e147e901f10/ss_f20aee598cf31823dc33590950365e147e901f10.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776167905","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896250/f20aee598cf31823dc33590950365e147e901f10/ss_f20aee598cf31823dc33590950365e147e901f10.600x338.jpg?t=1776167905"}],"short_description":"Enter the war-torn world of Ve\u00e1, where sci-fi and fantasy collide in Liquidation, an immersive RTS. Lead your armies and harness powerful abilities in a high-stakes battle for Quenrium, the mysterious substance that holds Ve\u00e1\u2019s fate.","steam_appid":896250,"support_info":{"email":"hello@liquidationgame.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://liquidationgame.com/"}